    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you are a vampire with an endless hunger. Every night, you must descend upon the village and collect as many chess pieces as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, move across the board to collect chess pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your cards to plan the perfect path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the same type of chess pieces to maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don\u2019t collect enough points by dawn, your immortal life will come to an end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you survive the night, you can enhance your deck with new cards or upgrades.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >53 unique cards in this demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random upgrades for endless variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And\u2026 maybe more surprises!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please add to your wishlist, thank you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you are a vampire with an endless hunger. Every night, you must descend upon the village and collect as many chess pieces as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, move across the board to collect chess pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your cards to plan the perfect path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the same type of chess pieces to maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don\u2019t collect enough points by dawn, your immortal life will come to an end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you survive the night, you can enhance your deck with new cards or upgrades.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >53 unique cards in this demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random upgrades for endless variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And\u2026 maybe more surprises!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please add to your wishlist, thank you!</p>",
